        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens Ramble and starts listening."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把一句话交给随口记：AI 整理成待办、账目、账单、到期或笔记，你确认后再保存。不填内容就直接开始听。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Give Ramble a sentence: AI turns it into a to-do, ledger entry, bill, expiry or note, and you confirm before it's saved. Leave it empty to start listening right away."
          }
